<title>FINLAND: MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</title>
<headline>MOST HELIBOR INTEREST RATES STEADY AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Most Helibor interest rates</p>
<p>were steady at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Friday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate was flat at 3.06.</p>
<p>			February 21 fix    February 20 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	  3.00 pct		3.00 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	  3.03 pct		3.03 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	  3.06 pct		3.06 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	  3.16 pct		3.16 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	  3.23 pct		3.24 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	 3.33 pct		3.34 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245</p>
</text>
